# Unplugged during a session (scenario "lost": the ESP32 board goes 2.5 s after the app first talks to it at its speed
# and comes back 3 s later): the text stays, the pill says the port is lost, the connection comes back by itself.
title Serial Console: port lost and back
env SERIAL_CONSOLE_DEMO lost
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1280x720 1024x600

key down
key enter
wait 300
key enter
wait 1500
shot connected
expect text "Connected"
wait 3000
shot lost
expect text "Port lost: waiting"
wait 3800
shot back
expect text "Connected"
key esc
wait 300
key esc
key esc
expect quit
